        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART V, LINE 4:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE INTENDED USE OF THE ENDOWMENT FUND IS TO SUPPORT INVESTIGATIVE JOURNALISM BY FUNDING AN INVESTIGATIVE REPORTER POSITION, WHO WILL FOCUS THEIR WORK ON A SPECIFIC FOCUS AREA EACH YEAR.</ExplanationTxt>
